The MIT license covers the source code in this repository. The data files in
web/data/ are derived from third-party data and keep their own terms:

- Terrain: Kartverket DTM (CC BY 4.0) - credit "Kartverket".
- Map tiles (basemap_topo.jpg, basemap_grey.jpg): (c) Kartverket, CC BY 4.0.
- Lake depth data and lake outlines: NVE (Norges vassdrags- og energidirektorat).
  Credit NVE; depth data for non-commercial use only and not for navigation.
- Land uplift: NKG2016LU (Nordic Geodetic Commission / Lantmateriet), CC BY 4.0.
- Cultural heritage sites (kulturminner.json): Riksantikvaren, open data (NLOD) - credit Riksantikvaren.
- three.js (web/vendor/three): MIT, (c) three.js authors (see its LICENSE file).
